// v6.53 — THE SCRIBE PURGE: the demo boss, The Conscious Feather,
// the Summoner Feather, the bag and the inscriptions ALL DIED (the
// user's word). THE FIRST TRACE SURVIVES (the beam weapon, now in
// the Beam Weapons bag, rendered with the god's fusion-ray
// technique) and THE INK AURORA (the code-drawn wings, now in the
// Cosmetics bag and finally VISIBLE).
// ENGLISH (en-US).

Items: {
	PrimerTrazo: {
		DisplayName: The First Trace
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The quill that wrote the world's first line, charged with light.
			HOLD the click: five traces converge into ONE FUSION RAY
			(the oil-slick rainbow runs along it, the core burns white
			and the noise flows from mouth to tip — the god's technique).
			At full charge the damage triples.
			'''
		Prueba: NO MANA COST — test weapon: channel without fear.
	}

	AuroraDeTinta: {
		DisplayName: The Ink Aurora
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The code-forged wings: ten feathers of prismatic light
			woven in the air.
			At night the full spectrum runs along the wing; at day the
			ink pales to white-gold.
			Mothron-speed flight (fast, no hover penalty), 240 flight
			time, no fall damage, and the Empress' mid-air acceleration.
			If you wear real wings, the aurora folds away and lifts
			their flight time to its floor.
			'''
		FormaDia: The ink is WHITE-GOLD: the page bathes the wing.
		FormaNoche: The ink is PRISM: the spectrum runs along the wing.
	}
}

